GetCurrShift [SimTalk]
Returns the name of the shift of the ShiftCalendar designated by <Path> that is currently active.
Remarks
This is the name you typed into the column Shift on the tab Shift Times.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.GetCurrShift → string
Watchable
The read-only attribute is watchable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type string.
Example
shift := root.MyShiftCalendar.GetCurrShift
See also
Tab Shift Times
Shift [ShiftCalendar]
GetCurrShift [SimTalk]
